OL,3,ANobel Prize awarded for showing how
OL,4,Anerve cells shape feelings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Nobel Committee praised the trio
OL,7,Ffor laying the foundation of a new era
OL,8,Fin neuroscience and revealing the
OL,9,Fneural circuits behind "specific
OL,10,Fmemories, feelings, and behaviours
OL,11,Frelevant for neurological and
OL,12,Fpsychiatric disorders".
OL,14,FIn clinical medicine, researchers are
OL,15,Fusing the method to try to restore
OL,16,Fsight in people with visual impairment.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
